abstract: "AsiBackbone 7.0.0 is a major release of the Accountable Systems Infrastructure package family for .NET. It binds acknowledgment responses to the actor that received the challenge, binds capability grants to the expected subject and operation, and adds explicit Unspecified zero values to the DLP failure-behavior and intent-risk enums so incomplete policy cannot silently inherit permissive defaults. Package IDs and the net10.0 target remain unchanged; the Handshakes and CapabilityTokens namespaces are renamed to Acknowledgments and CapabilityGrants, five Entity Framework Core columns and the serialized decision-receipt identifier are renamed to match, and AssemblyVersion advances to 7.0.0.0."
